{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"041bfa209c1bd8138686a87c00c5325476bd6721f47866508098b9a4f8ea9feb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":63,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华恩待以色列"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"这从以东的波斯拉来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"穿红衣服，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"装扮华美，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"能力广大，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大步行走的是谁呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是凭公义说话，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以大能施行拯救。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"你的装扮为何有红色？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的衣服为何像踹酒榨的呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"我独自踹酒榨；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"众民中无一人与我同在。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我发怒将他们踹下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"发烈怒将他们践踏。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的血溅在我衣服上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并且污染了我一切的衣裳。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为，报仇之日在我心中；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"救赎我民之年已经来到。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我仰望，见无人帮助；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我诧异，没有人扶持。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我自己的膀臂为我施行拯救；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的烈怒将我扶持。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我发怒，踹下众民；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"发烈怒，使他们沉醉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又将他们的血倒在地上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华对以色列的良善"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"我要照耶和华一切所赐给我们的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"提起他的慈爱和美德，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并他向以色列家所施的大恩；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这恩是照他的怜恤","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和丰盛的慈爱赐给他们的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他说：他们诚然是我的百姓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不行虚假的子民；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这样，他就作了他们的救主。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们在一切苦难中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他也同受苦难；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并且他面前的使者拯救他们；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他以慈爱和怜悯救赎他们；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在古时的日子常保抱他们，怀搋他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"他们竟悖逆，使主的圣灵担忧。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他就转作他们的仇敌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亲自攻击他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时，他们","poem":1},{"noteId":75},{"text":"想起古时的日子—","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩西和他百姓，说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"将百姓和牧养他全群的人","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从海里领上来的在哪里呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"将他的圣灵降在他们中间的在哪里呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他荣耀的膀臂在摩西的右手边行动，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在他们前面将水分开，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要建立自己永远的名，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"带领他们经过深处，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如马行走旷野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他们不致绊跌的在哪里呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华的灵使他们得安息，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"仿佛牲畜下到山谷；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"照样，你也引导你的百姓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要建立自己荣耀的名。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["求主怜悯帮助"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"求你从天上垂顾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从你圣洁荣耀的居所观看。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的热心和你大能的作为在哪里呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你爱慕的心肠和怜悯向我们止住了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亚伯拉罕虽然不认识我们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列也不承认我们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你却是我们的父。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，你是我们的父；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从万古以来，你名称为「我们的救赎主」。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，你为何使我们走差离开你的道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我们心里刚硬、不敬畏你呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你为你仆人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为你产业支派的缘故，转回来。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的圣民不过暂时得这产业；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们的敌人已经践踏你的圣所。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们好像你未曾治理的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又像未曾得称你名下的人。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":75,"caller":"-","text":"原文是他","reference":{"chapter":63,"verse":11}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/63.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/64.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/62.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":19}